    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4509ba56b740ab6dbbfdd8cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重平常的行为，圣诞老人都看在眼里。\n所以只要你好好改过自新，\n圣诞老人总有一天会送礼物给你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "845030e40d8fe3366109621406fa57e80803c810866dd14e5d6eb16a68bea90f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
