    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78628bf9bd0c029e45b933be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣诞老人有在看着我，\n只要改正愚昧的行为就能收到礼物。\n这让我感到强烈的满足──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9254d515e2d7073e4d96afb7010bbb82eec78af574653d9aff77f693bded08a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072109.json",
      "json_path": [
