    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:599a15ac9b77ff74b29409ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣诞礼物的经验，\n毫无疑问地为八重无敌的成长做出了贡献……",
      "source_fingerprint": "628991f350afe12a45e281b097341a777b267514e03143c83efc50d32e2bdccf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:789ea94151ad6fdf5069febc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过无法在圣诞节当天\n收到圣诞老人的礼物，\n还是让人觉得有点寂寞──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db7313c8a65863b002f32b6f42936195a8deba4c4eda3598f9c7031faea2da1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a740571d4195746dcaf8e4c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实我想成为八重的圣诞老人",
