      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52de471a5d754da8baecfa55",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗨，八重的训练员。\n你找我有什么事？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ebdc26832e66440254652dbc6e26c598962fbed35a8ab4ee4dcb8552d4ecae2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12e1316183d01b6f3ab2017d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想让努力的八重无敌能收到\n圣诞老人的礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "250f55d42017e454fb29e262f248be29ebc86c4c9323d9e55c40adf67268cda1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a10f71a16d601cc70bc8412",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了执行这个计划，我决定拜托\n栗东宿舍的宿舍长富士奇石帮忙。\n我简单向她说明前几天的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d1f4ee51967f9610028b1a781bf9e76184b2de32208a7fdda51703ac4a87f33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f18c45aa42f9cd59f81cb69c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "富士奇石",
      "source_fingerprint": "630c9bd72789e662b81a8b83212e911d7bcbf6bb2d055023fb47ed14bb6bbee0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
