      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所谓圣诞老人的礼物，\n当然就是要早上起床时，\n就已经装在枕边的袜子里面才行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cdeeb56ed9d3dac5a4e66509a2161e13f241b62708d4ff6342f708d0391735b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
