    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cf2bea3ad9da13bde84a9ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我无法进入栗东宿舍，\n所以只能拜托住宿生\n晚上过去放礼物。",
